Terry Lambert <terry@cs.weber.edu> writes:

>Peter Merel <pete@extro.su.oz.au> wrote:
>] The US constitution is not the basis of the ERR - the US constitution
>] permits quite a number of laws that the ERR would not. Because the ERR
>] is intended for use outside the US, the US constitution wouldn't make
